Linus,

please pull ALSA updates for v2.6.31 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

containing the following changes.

There will be likely a few (device-specific) fix updates later in the
merge window, but it'd be appreciated if you merge this big chunk
beforehand. 


Thanks!

Takashi

